{
  "contract": "hivra.native-workspace.route-grammar",
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Every case is an href a native shell may observe or request. `expect` is the canonical dashboard route, or null when the route must be rejected. The dashboard (native-route-grammar.ts) and every native shell must return exactly `expect`. `shell` holds what a shell derives from the canonical route: the resource tab identity and the sidebar destination.",
